Definitely the most powerful and slickest machine I've ever had. Comes with a lot of features thanks to it being an MSI, plus with Nvidia software. In my first few months of having it, I've had little to no complaints at all regarding the software, however a few things should be noted about its build;

As is on par with monster gaming pc's like these, it can get VERY HOT, so much so that wasd keys can become painful to the touch, if you're somebody that games for long periods, definitely invest in a cooling pad, it will do you a lot of favors. But the heat is at no fault to the computer, that's just what happens when you want so much in such a small build. Another think worth mentioning, which is a common theme among other reviews of this build, depending on where your arms are when typing, the edges of the laptop may be a bit sharp for your taste, however adjusting the way you use it can fix that... just keep that in mind.

I don't have much to compare to, but I would say it is worth the price if you love gaming on the go. Pair this puppy with a case, mouse, and a cooling pad, and this baby can take you places. Great build, great performance, great computer. I'm now a big fan of MSI because of this.
